+  registerTool( u"ui_debug_dialog"_s, u"Diagnostics: open a dialog from the Qt event loop with a chosen parent and report whether it was shown. kind: file (new QFileDialog + exec), static (QFileDialog::getOpenFileNames), staticfilter (the same with QGIS' vector filter list) or plain (QDialog); parent: main (QGIS main window), active (the active window, e.g. the Data Source Manager) or none. The dialog closes itself after 'seconds' (default 2)."_s,
